id: temporal/differences/0098
area: temporal
op: Temporal.PlainDate.prototype.until, toString
in: str:"2020-01-01[u-ca=hebrew]" str:"2020-07-20[u-ca=hebrew]" undefined str:"month" undefined str:"halfExpand"
out: value: str:"P7M"
class: divergence
divergence.broiler-js: row F4: differences in another calendar ignore the rounding options (PlainDate, PlainYearMonth and ZonedDateTime) or measure months in ISO (PlainDateTime), so Hebrew 2020-01-01 until 2020-07-20 rounded to months is P6M24D, where it is P7M (the milestone's listed correction); correction, answered by SJL-10.5
